This project bundles no model weights. It is designed to run against an
OpenAI-compatible inference server, which you supply and license separately.

Benchmark ADAPTERS in bench/ reference third-party datasets and benchmarks
(SimpleQA, WideSearch, SWE-bench, OpenRCA, AIOpsLab/SREGym and others). Those
datasets are NOT redistributed here; the adapters fetch them from their sources,
and each remains under its own license and terms of use.
